    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24600" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβύω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>thrust through,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐς τὸ στόμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hp.
					<u>Superf.</u>
					5
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			 (from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-βυνέω</span></b> ), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαβυνέονται ὀϊστοὺς
				διὰ τῆς ἀριστερῆς</span> they <i>pass</i> arrows
				<i>through their</i> left hand, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				4.71
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			 (from <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δια-βύνω</span></b> ),
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πηδάλιον διὰ τῆς τρόπιος
			διαβύνεται</span> is <i>passed through</i> the keel, <i><span class="en">
				Id.
				2.96
			</span></i>.</div>
